{"agent":"fx-init-folds","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"In the `.ddflow` branch, `_load(repo, agent)` calls `_load_fresh`, which already reads the entire event log (`log.read_all()`) to compute `st`; the very next line `events = log.read_all()` reads the entire event log a second time on every MCP initialize. This leaves the full-log read cost in the exact path this change is meant to fix; a large `.ddflow` repo still pays that cost on every initialize, and if another ddflow process appends an event between the two reads, `events` and `st` are snapshots from different moments, so later `PR.detect`/`plan` can operate on inconsistent data.","digest":"36c5d22e39e0d667","location":"ddflow/api/surf_mcp.py:_fill","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/surf_mcp.py:_fill"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"The fix does not implement the intended cached digest/file. `_instructions` still calls `_instructions_text` on every invocation; `load_scope` only shares one loaded project within that call and is not a persisted cache. On a fresh process—the re-exec/reconnect case called out in B-mcp-initialize-folds-log—there is no in-memory cache yet, so `_instructions_text` still runs the upgrade-plan build and performs at least one full `model.fold`. A repository log large enough that a single fold exceeds a client connect timeout will therefore still fail to start. The added regression test runs twice in one process and permits one fold (`calls[0] <= 1`), so it cannot catch this remaining cold-start failure.","digest":"a2d42be73a327749","location":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py:_instructions","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py:_instructions"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":7622,"diff_sha":"ab90460c74f8ac31a3ed062609ed47edca84b1b96e4d723c26d07ac60c0a96b1","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":617.2,"family":"deepseek","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"48d12876e823a260","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-mcp-initialize-folds-log.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261021T173222Z-7f6e9f22.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"221690476eea68713706dc169d7c261ec2d6e5e8","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/_base.py":"100644 e23a107609bdb59d3bdd0e1527e75e610f8eceba","ddflow/api/surf_mcp.py":"100644 b5e7bf18951105f600ff88953e277ae50ceca0a8","ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py":"100644 11e5b31aceb7d6d7e66b9a328411dc50898d596d","tests/test_mcp_initialize_latency.py":"100644 b6b9711357abe1c41b0c0534783e3c1ff865d592"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b8632","round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/api/surf_mcp.py:_fill","ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py:_instructions"],"tree_sha":"221690476eea+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"ecf23e352afc67c652855fb2e","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":89205,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-mcp-initialize-folds-log","ts":"2026-10-21T17:42:40.305208Z"}
